dsabs035   abs           -0.001 -> 0.001
dsabs036   abs           +0.000001 -> 0.000001
dsabs037   abs           -0.000001 -> 0.000001
dsabs038   abs           +0.000000000001 -> 1E-12
dsabs039   abs           -0.000000000001 -> 1E-12

